// # Ai Ml
//
// Logline: Ai and machine learning primitives for std/ml. Phase 3.5: merged the prior std/ai/ml_lib/ tree into this directory. ml_lib/ was a near-duplicate with 5 unique files (autograd_engine, layer_linear, loss_ops, ml, optimizer); the 3 duplicate-name files (layer_attention, layer_conv2d, layer_norm) were dropped in favor of the comprehensive versions already here.
//
// Setup: Domain module of 32 files under std/ml. Pure compute, no caps.
//
// Beats:
//   1. Tensor family (3 files).
//   2. Ai ml family (2 files).
//   3. Activation family (1 file).
//   4. Merged-in ml_lib family (5 files: autograd_engine, layer_linear, loss_ops, ml facade, optimizer).

